//github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118748.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-22T17:57:20Z"},"body":"Fixes #118123\r\nFixes #79842\r\nFixes #101577\r\n\r\nIt turned out that when the graph texture is drawn it clamps the values, but when the reference frame line is drawn the `frame_y` value can become negative thus showing outside the graph view. This PR clamps the reference line height to the graph view height. The offset from the top is 2x the font height so the CPU/GPU info line won't be blocked.\r\n\r\nI also moved the `graph->get_size()` outside of the conditions because it is used in every each of them and the expressions get very noisy.\r\n\r\nResult:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cea49472-5271-4292-b55b-792ecfef6769","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118748/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118748/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason